    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913190/extras/cfa54bb42aa2666d27c1d2dd007abed3.avif?t=1754613881\" width=600 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coco is a little cat on a big adventure. Help her to uncover the mystery of the missing members of the Adventurers Guild in the charming Tambryn Valley. Along the way, you'll explore a cozy, vibrant world full of secrets, meet delightful characters, and solve thoughtful, story-driven puzzles. With a sprinkle of humor and a touch of self-awareness, Bravest Coconut invites you, the player, to also be a part of her story. It's a warm and whimsical tale of courage, connection, and finding your place in the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the cozy story while exploring the beautiful valley.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full cast of quirky characters with countless nonlinear dialogue choices.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a bunch of story-driven puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a long list of secrets and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and fun combat system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand crafted pixel art\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of handy accessibility options to craft a personalised playing experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy original soundtrack\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shenanigans</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913190/extras/cfa54bb42aa2666d27c1d2dd007abed3.avif?t=1754613881\" width=600 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coco is a little cat on a big adventure. Help her to uncover the mystery of the missing members of the Adventurers Guild in the charming Tambryn Valley. Along the way, you'll explore a cozy, vibrant world full of secrets, meet delightful characters, and solve thoughtful, story-driven puzzles. With a sprinkle of humor and a touch of self-awareness, Bravest Coconut invites you, the player, to also be a part of her story. It's a warm and whimsical tale of courage, connection, and finding your place in the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the cozy story while exploring the beautiful valley.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full cast of quirky characters with countless nonlinear dialogue choices.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a bunch of story-driven puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a long list of secrets and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and fun combat system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand crafted pixel art\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of handy accessibility options to craft a personalised playing experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy original soundtrack\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shenanigans</p></li></ul>",
